id: pm-slack-stcv
title: Independently measure statement coverage in the pm-slack release gate
description: The existing coverage gate equates statement coverage with lines and enforces only lines/branches/functions. Add independent raw V8 block statement measurement and meaningful regression fixtures without narrowing source inventory or lowering thresholds. Certification pm-slack-c104 reports only the measured dimensions.
